; A posting that names a lot, {price} [date] or {=price} [date], posts to
; exactly that lot, whatever its account holds and whatever its cost:
; `@ =price` fixates a lot it creates, as writing {=price} would, and
; never one the posting names.  Each story below has accounts and a lot
; of its own.
;
; Manual buys 10 AAPL {=$50.00} and sells `-10 AAPL {$50.00} @ =$60.00`:
; the sale names the floating lot, so the account keeps its fixated lot
; and goes short the floating one, and -V values that pair at the later
; $7 price against $50.00, $430.00; a sale written {=$50.00} would close
; the lot.  Symmetric buys `10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01] @ =$5`, the floating
; lot, and sells it naming it the same way, which closes it with a $10
; gain.  Transfer moves such a lot with both legs written
; `{$5} [2020/01/02] @ =$5`: the lot arrives floating.  The three Virtual
; postings post the floating lot too, the negative [Virtual:Equity] among
; them.  ShortOpen's short sale, `-10 AAPL {$6} [2020/01/04] @ =$6`, opens
; the floating lot {$6}, which -V values at $7 a unit, $-70.
; ShortCover's short sale at a plain cost, `-10 AAPL @ $6`, creates the
; lot {$6} [2020/01/05], and the cover, which names that lot at a fixated
; cost, `10 AAPL {$6} [2020/01/05] @ =$5`, closes it with a $10 gain.
; Neighbour:A holds the typed lot 10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/06] when
; Neighbour:B buys the same lot at `@ =$5`: both hold the floating lot,
; which -V values at $70 each.
;
; 3.4.1 set the fixated flag on the named lot itself whenever a cost was
; fixated, for every account that held it: Manual's sale closed its lot,
; Symmetric, Transfer, Virtual, ShortOpen and Neighbour's lots all showed
; as {=...}, and -V held them at their lot prices.  Since the marker is
; part of a lot's identity (#1454), the lot a posting names is now the
; lot it posts to, and a fixated cost reaches no other posting's lot.

P 2020/03/01 AAPL $7

2012/04/10 My Broker
    Manual:Brokerage            10 AAPL {=$50.00}
    Manual:Brokerage:Cash      $-500.00

2012/05/10 My Broker
    Manual:Brokerage           -10 AAPL {$50.00} @ =$60.00
    Manual:Brokerage:Cash       $600.00
    Manual:Gains

2020/01/01 Buy, naming the lot
    Symmetric:Broker      10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01] @ =$5
    Symmetric:Cash

2020/02/01 Sell, naming the lot as the purchase did
    Symmetric:Broker     -10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/01] @ =$6
    Symmetric:Cash        $60
    Symmetric:Gains

2020/01/02 Buy, naming the lot
    Transfer:Broker       10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/02] @ =$5
    Transfer:Cash

2020/02/02 Move to another broker, naming the lot on both legs
    Transfer:NewBroker    10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/02] @ =$5
    Transfer:Broker      -10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/02] @ =$5

2020/01/03 Buy in virtual accounts
    (Virtual:Tracking)    10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/03] @ =$5
    [Virtual:Budget]      10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/03] @ =$5
    [Virtual:Equity]     -10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/03] @ =$5

2020/01/04 Short sale naming its lot
    ShortOpen:Broker     -10 AAPL {$6} [2020/01/04] @ =$6
    ShortOpen:Cash

2020/01/05 Short sale
    ShortCover:Broker    -10 AAPL @ $6
    ShortCover:Cash

2020/02/05 Cover, naming the short lot
    ShortCover:Broker     10 AAPL {$6} [2020/01/05] @ =$5
    ShortCover:Cash      $-50
    ShortCover:Gains

2020/01/06 Typed floating lot
    Neighbour:A           10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/06]
    Neighbour:Opening

2020/01/06 Buy, naming the same lot
    Neighbour:B           10 AAPL {$5} [2020/01/06] @ =$5
    Neighbour:Cash

test bal --lots --flat --no-total --empty
   -10 AAPL {$50.00}
   10 AAPL {=$50.00}  Manual:Brokerage
             $100.00  Manual:Brokerage:Cash
            $-100.00  Manual:Gains
10 AAPL {$5.00} [2020/01/06]  Neighbour:A
10 AAPL {$5.00} [2020/01/06]  Neighbour:B
             $-50.00  Neighbour:Cash
-10 AAPL {$5.00} [2020/01/06]  Neighbour:Opening
                   0  ShortCover:Broker
              $10.00  ShortCover:Cash
             $-10.00  ShortCover:Gains
-10 AAPL {$6.00} [2020/01/04]  ShortOpen:Broker
              $60.00  ShortOpen:Cash
                   0  Symmetric:Broker
              $10.00  Symmetric:Cash
             $-10.00  Symmetric:Gains
                   0  Transfer:Broker
             $-50.00  Transfer:Cash
10 AAPL {$5.00} [2020/01/02]  Transfer:NewBroker
10 AAPL {$5.00} [2020/01/03]  Virtual:Budget
-10 AAPL {$5.00} [2020/01/03]  Virtual:Equity
10 AAPL {$5.00} [2020/01/03]  Virtual:Tracking
end test

test bal -V --flat --no-total --empty
             $430.00  Manual:Brokerage
             $100.00  Manual:Brokerage:Cash
            $-100.00  Manual:Gains
              $70.00  Neighbour:A
              $70.00  Neighbour:B
             $-50.00  Neighbour:Cash
             $-70.00  Neighbour:Opening
                   0  ShortCover:Broker
              $10.00  ShortCover:Cash
             $-10.00  ShortCover:Gains
             $-70.00  ShortOpen:Broker
              $60.00  ShortOpen:Cash
                   0  Symmetric:Broker
              $10.00  Symmetric:Cash
             $-10.00  Symmetric:Gains
                   0  Transfer:Broker
             $-50.00  Transfer:Cash
              $70.00  Transfer:NewBroker
              $70.00  Virtual:Budget
             $-70.00  Virtual:Equity
              $70.00  Virtual:Tracking
